WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.220
- It's always nice to finish up the hour

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:04.680
with something uplifting
and fun from social media.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.980
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.280
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.390
(audience applauding)

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:10.410
So it happened.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.700
I found the Internet's most
unlikely celebrity news junkie,

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.580
71-year-old, retired Uncle Butch.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.480
And it turns out

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.030
he's our associate producer,
Morgan's, real uncle,

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.590
and we have him on the line right now

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:26.130
watching on Fox 26 Houston at three.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.840
What's up, Uncle Butch?

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.575
(audience applauding)

00:00:30.575 --> 00:00:31.408
- Hey

00:00:31.408 --> 00:00:32.430
- What's up Texas?

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.360
Well it's great to meet you.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.840
So how did you get into
celebrity magazines?

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.630
- Well, I retired from
the aero craft industry

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.910
about 45 years,

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.860
and a guy at work

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:48.000
was bringing his girlfriend's
celebrity magazines to work,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.710
and we'd read 'em on break.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:51.330
But I'm not a fast reader

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:54.030
so I asked him could I bring them home?

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:57.000
Well, next time he brought 'em to work

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.400
he gave me a stack, and he just kept

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.260
on bringing and bringing them.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.210
And I would bring them
home, and I'd read them

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:05.910
to the wee hours at night.

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.340
Some of my favorites was Brad Pitt.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.500
I love Tom Cruise.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.090
I love his new movie.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:14.880
And then some of the
girls that I really like

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:18.000
is Jennifer Garner, she's a sweetheart.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.000
And I just got into
reading the good people.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:24.930
Sandra Bullock.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.220
Reese Witherspoon.

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:29.670
I liked reading the nice
people in the magazines.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:31.050
- I love that.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:32.010
I love all those people.

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:34.800
I love how you view it too,
like with such positivity.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.840
So like what do you love
about these magazines?

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:38.040
Is it that it is positive?

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.040
You love supporting all these,

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:42.270
these people that you find cool
or like pretty good humans?

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:44.152
- Well, when I get up in the morning

00:01:44.152 --> 00:01:47.550
I turn on the news and
then I get, I'm sad.

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:50.700
Cause to me, all, anything
in the news is sad.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:54.990
And then I go to my Hallmark
movies and that keeps me happy.

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:57.810
But then I relate that to my magazines.

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:01.741
When I read my magazines, I
read about all the good stuff.

00:02:01.741 --> 00:02:04.770
I don't need to read about the bad people.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.930
We got enough of them in the world.

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:11.912
But I enjoy reading my magazines
and trying to be happy.

00:02:11.912 --> 00:02:13.880
- I love that Uncle Butch.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:15.990
Oh my god, you wanna say
hi to your niece, Morgan?

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.790
She's right over there, just saying.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.181
- Hey, Morgan.

00:02:19.181 --> 00:02:20.420
- Hey Uncle Butch, love you.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:23.302
- I am adopt, Morgan, I'm
adopting your Uncle Butch.

00:02:23.302 --> 00:02:24.150
(laughs)

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:25.846
Uncle Butch, everybody.

00:02:25.846 --> 00:02:26.679
(audience applauding)

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:27.512
We love you so much.

00:02:27.512 --> 00:02:29.433
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:31.890
That's not all though.

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.650
Our season long partner,
Pilot pen makers of FriXion,

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.540
the Go-To Erasable pen of
The Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.820
want to celebrate
fearless people like you.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.860
So they are giving you a thousand dollars

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.891
and you can use it for even
more magazine subscriptions.

00:02:43.891 --> 00:02:46.575
(audience applauding)

